  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, each day when they shape their veils, the huay selects one of the following veils: Geri and Freki, H’s Flowered Regalia, Nymph’s Visage, or Verdant Vambraces. This veil is considered to be shaped on the huay, and does not count against their total veils shaped or veil slots (it is denoted by the “+1” under Veils on Table 1-1: Huay). They may invest essence in it normally, as well as bind it if they have unlocked the bind slot for it. If bound, it likewise does not count against the bind slot.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/huay#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
